しくお願い致します。\n\nいつものトライアスロンスーツ姿の真澄くんをお願いします。\nポーズや構図など全てお任せで、自由に描いて頂けると幸いです。\n\n【スーツ資料】\nhttps://imgur.com/a/rIUTYWW", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@WLhYA81jJg/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/49c19648/uploads/origins/9cda9774-6458-4a9f-a997-f7fe18979f0b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0896d55795b9bf0b0e2089273900ba5d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/49c19648/uploads/origins/9cda9774-6458-4a9f-a997-f7fe18979f0b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0896d55795b9bf0b0e2089273900ba5d, https://si.imgix.net/49c19648/uploads/origins/9cda9774-6458-4a9f-a997-f7fe18979f0b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf7d968afcb2bc34c419a409b28c2044 2x, https://si.imgix.net/49c19648/uploads/origins/9cda9774-6458-4a9f-a997-f7fe18979f0b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac346c9cd6985770d6df7c8650ec915d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、またお邪魔します。\n\nメインカラーが青系の衣装\n要求ファイル形式：透明背景（PNG）、PSD（使用可能な場合のみ）。\n衣装はラテックス製だ。猫耳あって\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/mobile/folders/1V_m9HxELvwy2sbTMTSznsABA0j76Xj5t?sort=13&direction=a\n\nご検討いただけますと幸いです。\nよろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@WLhYA81jJg/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9eb00790/uploads/origins/62aec29d-0339-4e39-960d-d8744ec644d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ae482fc4dfe6cba7159d3a1f4f223b6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9eb00790/uploads/origins/62aec29d-0339-4e39-960d-d8744ec644d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ae482fc4dfe6cba7159d3a1f4f223b6, https://si.imgix.net/9eb00790/uploads/origins/62aec29d-0339-4e39-960d-d8744ec644d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e4b75df0638a16c29e515320a7e3a118 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9eb00790/uploads/origins/62aec29d-0339-4e39-960d-d8744ec644d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e168d9061eb861b6be24cfda7499042 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "短期間にすみません！OCのイラストもう一枚お願いします。\nちょっと目が大きめの表情で書いてもらえると嬉しいです！\n膝下くらいまで写る感じで色っぽい感じの構図でよろしくお願いします。\n\n（少しカラーが変わってます。）\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1pxGwE6Ahg-wsxsc0B2dWsXzOlxHDQqsH/view?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@WLhYA81jJg/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/215b25a9/uploads/origins/8f23d628-e188-4c0b-9cf4-53dc7df601f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=676c308bd83069185302e0f41be35aa8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/215b25a9/uploads/origins/8f23d628-e188-4c0b-9cf4-53dc7df601f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=676c308bd83069185302e0f41be35aa8, https://si.imgix.net/215b25a9/uploads/origins/8f23d628-e188-4c0b-9cf4-53dc7df601f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d742e5edc148978f4408d1de0af079cd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/215b25a9/uploads/origins/8f23d628-e188-4c0b-9cf4-53dc7df601f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a642d469916828bd48226ab446358da 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, teacher! I love your artworks! If it's okay, I'd like to request a cute illustration for my character Bawnana. Please draw her with her hair down (there is a long hair reference in the folder). She has a very outgoing, teasing personality and likes to draw. You can choose the pose! Thank you very much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Yh-r3J6Jev4OVe6Ravwfb7I-dHHSlSgx?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@WLhYA81jJg/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/32eff477/uploads/origins/54fc81ce-4e82-4b20-bb1c-7c6aedd94290?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09524a645